    }" } Use this prompt too: A hyper-realistic, cinematic scene of the uploaded person at a desk, making direct eye contact with the camera while carefully painting his own figure. The figurine stands on a clear acrylic display base and is unusually large-about half the height of the real person-so it reads prominently in frame. Both the person and the figurine wear the exact same outfit with matching details exact same person. The desk is scattered with realistic miniature-painting tools, brushes, paints, and hobby items, creating a creative workshop mood. The figurine looks ultra-realistic with lifelike human skin tone, natural facial features,and a premium PVC texture. Realistic indoor background, cinematic studio lighting, and crisp, sharp detail.

